constant>\n \t\t<constant name=\"FLAG_FORCE_LINEAR\" value=\"1\" enum=\"LoaderFlags\" is_bitfield=\"true\">\n+\t\t\tIf set, the image is converted from sRGB to linear color space.","path":"doc/classes/ImageFormatLoader.xml","commit_id":"c16318eb872fb96892530947255473ef38c75d7e","original_commit_id":"c16318eb872fb96892530947255473ef38c75d7e","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"```suggestion\n\t\t\tIf set, the image is converted from sRGB to linear encoding.\n```\n\n“Color space” is a fairly ambiguous term throughout literature and the internet and in Godot it generally represents something like “HSL” vs “RGB with sRGB encoding” or in texture formats it describes a combination of colour primaries and transfer function (encoding).\n\nSo for clarity, Godot now uses the term “encoding” to describe how colour values are encoded.","created_at":"2026-05-27T14:09:10Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T14:10:07Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119612#discussion_r3311343166","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119612","_links":{"self":{"href":